WEBVTT

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:07.575 line:0 align:center
Controls is a special widget: one card that holds as many buttons as fit.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:12.275 line:0 align:center
Each button can do something specific, like opening another dash.

00:00:12.725 --> 00:00:16.525 line:0 align:center
In Widgets, open Controls to see the buttons on the card.

00:00:17.425 --> 00:00:23.500 line:0 align:center
A button can open a sub dash, open an Android app on your phone, or run a MOTO-HUB action.

00:00:26.375 --> 00:00:29.300 line:0 align:center
Let's open a button that links to Spotify.

00:00:29.775 --> 00:00:32.175 line:0 align:center
What it does shows its current action.

00:00:35.325 --> 00:00:38.700 line:0 align:center
Search for another action, or pick one from the list.

00:00:39.525 --> 00:00:45.325 line:0 align:center
MOTO-HUB actions include starting or stopping trip recording, and switching day and night.

00:00:45.875 --> 00:00:49.650 line:0 align:center
Spotify is selected because it's an app from your phone.

00:00:50.375 --> 00:00:53.975 line:0 align:center
All apps loads the list of apps installed on your phone.

00:00:54.525 --> 00:00:56.600 line:0 align:center
Does nothing clears the button.

00:00:57.050 --> 00:00:59.675 line:0 align:center
Text sets the label under the icon.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:03.250 line:0 align:center
Type any label you like, or leave it empty.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:08.625 line:0 align:center
Icon comes from the library, or you can use your own picture.

00:01:08.975 --> 00:01:11.050 line:0 align:center
Background sets the fill.

00:01:11.275 --> 00:01:14.175 line:0 align:center
Shape and outline adds a border, or a glow.

00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:19.025 line:0 align:center
Laid out as arranges the buttons in a row, a column or a grid.

00:01:20.025 --> 00:01:23.400 line:0 align:center
The difference shows when the card holds enough buttons.

00:01:25.275 --> 00:01:29.500 line:0 align:center
Style sets the look of the buttons: Filled, Outline or Glass.

00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:32.825 line:0 align:center
Glass works well over a background photo.
